# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineElint = ELINT array
    .desc = An electronic-intelligence mast. It emits nothing; it only listens for active radars and jammers and reads back the direction their emissions come from. Cross its bearings with a datalinked ally's to fix an emitter. It runs deaf while your own ship is emitting.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineElintCircuitboard = ELINT array machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in ELINT arrays.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineIrst = IRST array
    .desc = An infrared search and track mast. It hunts ships by the heat bleeding off their hull, seeing far past the naked eye, though a cold or well-shielded target slips right past it.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineIrstCircuitboard = IRST array machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in IRST arrays.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineJammer = jammer array
    .desc = A radar jammer. It floods a wedge ahead of the mount with noise, blinding every radar-emitting ship caught in it, friend or foe, until they close to burn-through range. It emits nothing a sensor reads as a contact, but ELINT hears it plainly as a jammer.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineJammerCircuitboard = jammer array machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in jammer arrays.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineRadar = radar array
    .desc = An active radar mast. It floods the black with pulses and reads the echoes, seeing far and clearly even through cold and dark, but every sweep is a beacon that enemy ELINT can home in on from twice as far as the radar can resolve.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineRadarCircuitboard = radar array machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in radar arrays.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineRwr = radar warning receiver
    .desc = A cheap warning antenna. It hears only emissions that actually illuminate the ship - a radar beam painting the hull, a jam wedge washing over it - and reads back the direction they come from. Unlike an ELINT mast it keeps warning even while your own ship is emitting.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineRwrCircuitboard = radar warning receiver machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in radar warning receivers.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineVisualSearch = optical search array
    .desc = A gimballed optics mast that picks out ships against the black by eye alone. Short-ranged but reliable.

# Resources\Prototypes\_KS14\Entities\Structures\Machines\sensors.yml
ent-KsMachineVisualSearchCircuitboard = optical search array machine board
    .desc = An electronics board used in optical search arrays.
